<section class="container" style="padding-block:1rem 4rem;max-width:1100px;">
  <h2 class="display-md reveal" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Developments that did not make it into the range</h2>
  <p class="body-lg reveal" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;max-width:760px;">Two projects included a new product as well as brand and packaging: <strong>Graf Zeppelin</strong>, with the pack claim “the longest chocolate in the world”, and <strong>Character de Cipan</strong>, a marzipan confection whose product and packaging share the same pyramid shape.</p>
  <p class="body-lg reveal reveal-delay-1" style="margin-bottom:2rem;max-width:760px;">Both went through the test phase and were not taken into the range. That is exactly what the test is for: the decision was made before investing in production tooling, line changeovers and listings. The same applies to several brand developments created as a reserve for future ranges that have not been launched to this day.</p>
